      <VERS vnumber="5"> Thou carriest them away as with a <gr str="2229">flood</gr>; they <gr str="1961">are </gr>
        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> as </STYLE> a <gr str="8142">sleep</gr>: in the <gr str="1242">morning </gr>
